# Build context for web/Dockerfile. Scoped to that Dockerfile, so no other
# image's context is affected.
#
# Everything is excluded, then only the two things the image serves are allowed
# back in. Deny-all is what makes this safe by construction rather than by
# maintenance: `node_modules`, `.tsbuildinfo`, `spec/`, and — for anyone who
# points a build at the repository root instead — `.moon/cache`, which is a
# symlink to a machine-local directory and must never enter a build context,
# are all excluded because they were never allowed in.

*

!dist
!nginx.conf.template
